events:
    event-death-hoster-tully:
        title: Death of Hoster Tully
        type: death
        place: place-riverrun
        date: "299"
        participants:
            - person: person-hoster-tully
              role: principal
        properties:
            cause: Natural causes (prolonged illness)
        notes: Lord Hoster Tully died of a prolonged illness at Riverrun early in ASOS. His funeral was a river burial in Tully tradition. His son Edmure inherited the lordship of Riverrun.
